Package: rapsimng.decide
Title: Decision-Oriented Analysis Interface for APSIM Next Generation Outputs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bangou", "Zheng", , "zheng.bangyou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a high-level interface for analysing APSIM Next Generation simulation outputs to support structured decision-making workflows. The package coordinates domain-specific decision modules (e.g. cultivar selection, experimental design) and standardises their outputs into reproducible decision reports. It does not perform APSIM simulations or implement decision logic directly, but serves as an orchestration layer connecting analysis results with reporting and downstream interpretation.
